{"entryId":"1776","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1776:1","sourceSha256":"c2a3600152de9fc18b3f96fcb74cfaa6c719a8da006a75c208d8cc5156af0075","englishSha256":"58248586a49a53c92777a3f4a4c472eecda4a637d46ce66175eee8cfcbeda2c3","citations":[{"id":"1776:1:link-01","he":[43,67],"en":[70,111],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kohelet_Rabbah_3.2.2"},"reference":"Kohelet Rabbah 3:2:2","assessment":"The exact Kohelet unit names Yehoshua and his father, gives Kefar Agon, the season and both warnings, and says he heeded neither. Preserve Heilprin’s Kefar Anon and the witness spelling difference.","evidence":[{"reference":"Kohelet Rabbah 3:2:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kohelet_Rabbah_3.2.2"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"id":"1776:1:link-02","he":[68,85],"en":[116,142],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_6.5"},"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 6:5","assessment":"Genesis Rabbah contains the parallel with Kefar Channon and Tanchuma ben Chiyya. Both accounts give the warning about burial as part of the dream.","evidence":[{"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 6:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_6.5"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]},{"id":"1776:1:link-03","he":[159,187],"en":[290,320],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ecclesiastes_6.3"},"reference":"Ecclesiastes 6:3","assessment":"The two named midrashim cite this clause as Scripture within the narrative. The biblical text itself is checked separately.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ecclesiastes 6:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ecclesiastes_6.3"},"witness":"Miqra according to the Masorah"},{"reference":"Kohelet Rabbah 3:2:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kohelet_Rabbah_3.2.2"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 6:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_6.5"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2],"holds":[{"raw":"דכפר אנון","reason":"The Kohelet witness gives Agon and Genesis Rabbah Channon. Keep the name forms and report Heilprin’s Anon separately.","evidence":[]}],"notes":[{"text":"The two midrashim give different place and patronymic forms. The father’s warning alludes to Ecclesiastes 6:3. Retain Heilprin’s telling and observe the distinct witnesses.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Kohelet Rabbah 3:2:2","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Kohelet_Rabbah_3.2.2"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Bereshit Rabbah 6:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Bereshit_Rabbah_6.5"},"witness":"Midrash Rabbah -- TE"},{"reference":"Ecclesiastes 6:3","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ecclesiastes_6.3"},"witness":"Miqra according to the Masorah"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
